  "body": "Must be sold - Any Offer is considered!\r\n\r\nPerched in sought-after Castor Bay, this striking residence commands sweeping, panoramic vistas from its elevated vantage point. Rebuilt in 2011 by a celebrated local Kiwi builder and lavishly renovated in 2024, it masterfully marries generous space, refined design and contemporary comfort. Every detail is exquisitely considered, delivering effortlessly elegant coastal living.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• Breathtaking 180° Views – Enjoy sweeping vistas of the beach, sailboat, city skyline (including the Skytower), lake, and the majestic Rangitoto volcano, all from multiple living areas and the expansive deck.\r\n\r\n• 2024 Luxury Renovation – The current owners have spared no expense, adding custom storage solutions, high-end European motorised curtains, premium fire-rated European wallpaper, and wall-mounted televisions for a seamless, sophisticated look.\r\n\r\n• Generous Floor Plan – 4 bedrooms + 1 study + 1 rumpus (ideal as a private cinema room) + 3 bathrooms + 2 separate toilets + double garage.\r\n\r\n• Spectacular Living & Kitchen – The large central kitchen boasts a freestanding stone bench, a separate scullery, and incredible views. Open-plan living flows to a formal living area with floor-to-ceiling glass and a gas fireplace, plus a family room leading to an enormous deck.\r\n\r\n• Indoor-Outdoor Flow – Seamless connection to an expansive deck with 180-degree views, complete with an electrically adjustable louvre roof aluminium pergola, allowing you to enjoy the outdoor space in any weather.\r\n\r\n• Master Suite – Features an extra-large walk-in robe and a spacious ensuite, where you can enjoy sweeping ocean and Rangitoto views from this generous room.\r\n\r\n• Landscaped Gardens & Fully Fenced – Professionally designed gardens provide a beautiful year-round backdrop, while the fully fenced section ensures privacy and security.\r\n\r\n• Steps to the Beach – A walkway from the street takes you to the beach in just minutes. It is also a 4-minute walk to the Milford Cruising Club and the beautiful Milford Beach.\r\n\r\n• Top School Zones – Zoned for Campbells Bay School, Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High Schools, and Murrays Bay Intermediate – some of Auckland's most sought-after schools.\r\n\r\n• Convenient Transport – Easy motorway access, with a short drive to both Auckland CBD and Albany. Close to Milford's cafes, shops, and supermarkets.\r\n\r\nThe current owners are committed to a genuine sale and warmly invite you to experience this exceptional property for yourself. Don't miss this opportunity – contact us today to arrange a private viewing.",
